gn.md`](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/design.md) |\n| **Agile User Stories (21 Stories)** | Markdown / GDoc | [User Stories (GDoc)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NxDvYnWwoIs2JUpIntrHt8tfHQiQNfy4DEwHGqMQH6U/edit) | [`user_stories.md`](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/user_stories.md) |\n| **Architecture Diagrams (Mermaid)**| Markdown / GDoc | [Diagrams (GDoc)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nrm5wgf8b-Z0TUlzQG5WK6MIz427TjdzW-l4th_676g/edit) | [`architecture_diagrams.md`](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/architecture_diagrams.md) |\n| **Technical Specs & User Stories** | Markdown / GDoc | [Specs (GDoc)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/190GK62Mq6ogskpDSTs55Ff4OqBmLzD3-JoEzreiIUqQ/edit) | [`specs_and_user_stories.md`](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/specs_and_user_stories.md) |\n| **BRD (Tracked Changes & Comments)**| Google Doc | [BRD - Tracked Changes](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tHkqwbPOJ2HUlmTliaR-Ip0gnpAhxiIrXKcJxu0qlT4/edit) | — |\n| **Approved BRD (Clean v2)** | Markdown / GDoc | [Approved BRD (GDoc)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gW-lwRWN1sltc0jUolYhFktNlzJ3App5d7z4AkivZlI/edit) | [`brd_v2.md`](file:///google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3/hr_agentic_solution/brd_v2.md) |\n| **Project Drive Folder** | Folder | [Project Artifacts Folder](https://drive.google.com/corp/drive/folders/115mF5i6YL6YdECFDMdHJoO5gYTXVxEvl) | — |"}
